    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Critias Empire is a <strong>Turn-Based Strategy</strong> game where you build your empire <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949260/extras/7ae88683a94f1c47acc85b07dc483be3.webp?t=1754404078\" /></div> without war, combat and rival civilizations. Instead danger comes from <strong>Disasters</strong> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949260/extras/76ddccd73957c67885d2f056eea927e5.webp?t=1754404078\" /></div> rained down by the Gods of Olympus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a game for those who like the empire building of 4X games, as opposed to war and conflict, but still want a challenging dynamic world to play in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949260/extras/7ff423c1f9675a866c80f787281ddedc.webp?t=1754404078\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949260/extras/e5a6aafaf4e8191e3d91f27a20e8d583.poster.avif?t=1754404078\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949260/extras/e5a6aafaf4e8191e3d91f27a20e8d583.webm?t=1754404078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949260/extras/e5a6aafaf4e8191e3d91f27a20e8d583.mp4?t=1754404078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Critias Empire, the ancient Gods are vengeful and scheming. They will rain disasters down on your civilization, altering the map as volcanoes spew lava, floods wash away the land and earthquakes cause mountains to rise or crumble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each God has their own personality, desires and their own signature disaster. Give too much attention to Zeus and Poseidon may get angry, washing away your coastal settlements with a terrible storm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949260/extras/52809b449b51a14535e9f0ff454a6257.webp?t=1754404078\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949260/extras/327256a80bee00f7a6b38e1e81fd3acf.poster.avif?t=1754404078\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949260/extras/327256a80bee00f7a6b38e1e81fd3acf.webm?t=1754404078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949260/extras/327256a80bee00f7a6b38e1e81fd3acf.mp4?t=1754404078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Critias Empire rewards those who plan carefully or are quick to adapt. As disasters unfold, the changing map will present you with new opportunities and dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Focus on your economy and build transport networks between flourishing cities. Or devote your resources to prayer and worship of the Gods. How you rule will determine the fate of Atlantis.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Critias Empire is a <strong>Turn-Based Strategy</strong> game where you build your empire <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949260/extras/7ae88683a94f1c47acc85b07dc483be3.webp?t=1754404078\" /></div> without war, combat and rival civilizations. Instead danger comes from <strong>Disasters</strong> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949260/extras/76ddccd73957c67885d2f056eea927e5.webp?t=1754404078\" /></div> rained down by the Gods of Olympus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a game for those who like the empire building of 4X games, as opposed to war and conflict, but still want a challenging dynamic world to play in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949260/extras/7ff423c1f9675a866c80f787281ddedc.webp?t=1754404078\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949260/extras/e5a6aafaf4e8191e3d91f27a20e8d583.poster.avif?t=1754404078\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949260/extras/e5a6aafaf4e8191e3d91f27a20e8d583.webm?t=1754404078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949260/extras/e5a6aafaf4e8191e3d91f27a20e8d583.mp4?t=1754404078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Critias Empire, the ancient Gods are vengeful and scheming. They will rain disasters down on your civilization, altering the map as volcanoes spew lava, floods wash away the land and earthquakes cause mountains to rise or crumble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each God has their own personality, desires and their own signature disaster. Give too much attention to Zeus and Poseidon may get angry, washing away your coastal settlements with a terrible storm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949260/extras/52809b449b51a14535e9f0ff454a6257.webp?t=1754404078\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949260/extras/327256a80bee00f7a6b38e1e81fd3acf.poster.avif?t=1754404078\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949260/extras/327256a80bee00f7a6b38e1e81fd3acf.webm?t=1754404078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949260/extras/327256a80bee00f7a6b38e1e81fd3acf.mp4?t=1754404078\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Critias Empire rewards those who plan carefully or are quick to adapt. As disasters unfold, the changing map will present you with new opportunities and dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Focus on your economy and build transport networks between flourishing cities. Or devote your resources to prayer and worship of the Gods. How you rule will determine the fate of Atlantis.</p>",
